  * Drop a path slot on platform-detected removal (carrier loss, RTM_DELLINK,
  * address loss). Moves the slot to the CLOSED_DROPPED cleanup state and emits
diff --git a/src/mqvpn_client.c b/src/mqvpn_client.c
